{
  "slug": "raven-guard",
  "name": "Raven Guard",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Production protection layer for Claude Code. Hard-blocks destructive operations (force push, DROP TABLE, TRUNCATE, Terraform state edits). P1/P2/P3 incident SLAs with escalation ladder. Requires raven.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills** and **6 agents**.\n\n- **Skills** (2): `andie` (Multi-modal sharp thinker — FeynTech expert explanations (default) or Drama expert panel debates), `tools-landscape` (Tool and product registry for Andie pre-flight)\n- **Agents** (6): `guard-db-watch` (Use PROACTIVELY when any database operation is detected that could be destructive), `guard-firewall-watch` (Use PROACTIVELY when any network security rule changes are detected in infrastructure code or cloud console), `guard-git-watch` (Use PROACTIVELY on every git push, PR creation, or branch operation), `guard-incident-manager` (Use PROACTIVELY when any Guard agent raises an alert), `guard-infra-watch` (Use PROACTIVELY when infrastructure code changes are detected in Terraform, CloudFormation, Docker, or Kubernetes files), `guard-observability-watch` (Use PROACTIVELY to monitor logs, metrics, and access patterns for anomalies that signal security or data integrity issues)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install raven-guard@claude-community` from `giggsoinc/raven-guard`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 2,
    "agent": 6
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
